{"id":"n48324-2-4","stage":5,"title":"돌연변이 · 异类","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48324-2-4-1","ko":"오빠, 언니는 다 공부 잘하는데 우리 집에 왜 나 같은 돌연변이가 나왔지?","zh":"哥哥姐姐学习都很好，我们家怎么偏偏出了我这样的异类？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오빠,","meaning":"哥哥、大哥（女性对年长男性的亲切称呼）","explanation":"오빠：哥哥、大哥（女性对年长男性的亲切称呼）","readings":[{"term":"오빠","audio":"/audio/14e10e3b73bff8540288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68006","senseId":"2","lemma":"오빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오빠","audio":"/audio/14e10e3b73bff8540288.mp3"}},{"text":"언니는","meaning":"姐姐（女性对姐姐的称呼）","explanation":"언니：姐姐（女性对姐姐的称呼）；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"1","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언니는","audio":"/audio/577311129f79563d5ae1.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"공부","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}},{"text":"잘하는데","meaning":"棒","explanation":"잘하다：棒；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘하는데","audio":"/audio/e0193e5a5522da7e8b51.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma"